function guide(){if(started&&state.hp<=0)return;modal('Field guide',controlsHTML()+'<h3>Read the abbey</h3><p>Strike candles for echoes. Watch for a cracked wall and a high, sealed route. Rest at a shrine to save, recover, and refill two healing flasks.</p><p class="guide-note">Hold Jump to rise higher. Strike again during recovery to continue a combo. Dodge through a threat for a brief safe window. A close dodge restores 6 resonance.</p><p>Gamepad: left stick to move; A to jump; X to strike; B to cast; RB to dodge; Y to use; LB to heal. Touch controls appear on touch screens. Landscape gives the best view.</p><p>Progress is saved in this browser. The game can run offline. <a href="downloads/vesper-source-and-game.zip" download>Download the game and source</a>, extract the ZIP, then open dist/index.html.</p>',[{label:'BACK',run:closeModal}], 'guide');}
